"""Studiora AI - local study assistant (Flask + SQLite + Ollama).

Key design points
-----------------
* Answers are generated by a background thread per chat ("job"), not by the browser
  request. Switching chats, reloading or closing the tab never stops a generation;
  the browser simply re-attaches to the running job.
* Uploaded documents are chunked and (when an embedding model is available) embedded.
  Small documents are sent to the model whole; large ones use hybrid semantic+keyword
  retrieval, so "summarise this file" style questions always see real document text.
"""
